1,644 copies on Steam. That's pretty cool!Episode 1 has a new Russian and an Italian translation in the game, thanks to 2 kind volunteers who reached out. I'm testing the new build and will hopefully push it live on Steam in the next 2 weeks","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T19:58:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706696594","verified_at":"2026-10-21T02:51:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3820530-1837955055357495","game_id":"steam-3820530","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo released!","summary":"Friends of the Bru & Boegie clan - we did it. It took almost a year of full-time development to get this Episode 2 demo over the line. Today is a momentous day. I only ask that you enjoy it, and if you do enjoy it, please Wishlist it.Thanks for playing! 🙏❤️","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-10T17:02:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055357495","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3820530-1836506165570351","game_id":"steam-3820530","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Deck Works Great!","summary":"I'm pleased to announce that Bru & Boegie: Episode 2 - Get da SUGAR! works flawlessly out the box on the Steam Deck!The input is simple - left click to interact, right click to examine, the right trackpad works as a mouse, and either clicking in the trackpad serves as a click or using the right and left bumper triggers for left and right mouse clicks serve the same purpose. 👍The hamburger button serves as 'Esc' which brings up the Pause Menu.And that's about it! Some more pics and GIFs below:","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-03T12:20:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165570351","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3820530-1836506165568345","game_id":"steam-3820530","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo launching Friday 10 July!","summary":"Peeps, good news - it seems like all my ducks are now in a row and - all things being equal - looking set to launch the demo for Episode 2 next week Friday 10th July!It's been a long road to this point, and I so look forward to putting this game in your hands.Until then - stay keef. 🙌🙏","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-02T15:24:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165568345","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3820530-1833334318572449","game_id":"steam-3820530","kind":"announcement","title":"Final Stretch YOOO","summary":"Episode 2Allo! WOW this game has been a LOT of work, lol! I go to bed dreaming about coding Bru & Boegie!I really do think this is the final stretch. I miiight have overscoped it a bit but really wanted to make a splash with this one, a person only really gets one shot with first impressions of a game.I've passed a build on to Tiana the Sound Mixer so she can set the reverb levels and general audio mix (I recorded Bru & Boegie's voices much better this time and had the Sound Designer mix those p","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-22T17:36:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318572449","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3820530-1831432155576855","game_id":"steam-3820530","kind":"announcement","title":"Almost There!","summary":"Friends! I'm getting close to finishing up on Episode 2's demo.It's been a tremendous amount of work, and I'm very proud with how it's shaping up. ːsteamhappyːIt's still a couple weeks away from being ready to push the BIG RED RELEASE BUTTON.I hope it's a worthy successor to Episode 1. The demo itself is probably the same size or bigger than the full game of Episode 1 and works as a self-contained whole and also sets up a lot for the much bigger game of Episode 2 that follows. The demo is the fi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-04T08:17:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155576855","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3820530-1825093633187325","game_id":"steam-3820530","kind":"announcement","title":"Progress Report!","summary":"Dear Bru & Boegie-o-nites, I've been hard at work since last year on Episode 2, and it looks like I'm starting to see the light at the end of the tunnel. 🙌 To make sure the demo made sense I kind of had to finish development on the entire game to make sure there's a golden thread running through everything, and to ensure all the setups pay off later. So, this post is to communicate where I am with things.The DemoMy plan from the start was to release a fully-featured demo of the first bit of the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-20T09:36:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825093633187325","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3820530-1806064758764475","game_id":"steam-3820530","kind":"announcement","title":"'Bru & Boegie: Episode 2 - Get da SUGAR!' Announced, and more!","summary":"'Bru & Boegie: EPISODE 2 - Get da SUGAR!' Announced!Welcome, friends! Some exciting Bru & Boegie news in this post!Episode 2 has been announced! Ha cha cha cha. We pick things up directly after the events of Episode 1. It's now... time to 'Get da SUGAR!'. Ma boi Bru gotta get a coffee somehow. I've completed much of the story outlining and plan to start production on it once I'm done with Episode 1's launch preps.Episode 2 is shaping up to be roughly twice the length of Episode 1, also featuring","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-07-29T08:15:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1806064758764475","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3820530":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:00:36Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:00:36Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3820530":"2026-10-26T11:00:36Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3820530":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:00:36Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:00:36Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:00:36Z"},"4852430":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:00:36Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:00:36Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:00:36Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3820530","app_id":3820530,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:22Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"c05d1bc142c114e729b2bd7b597b8729a445a15c301dda08d402e621a14f55d1","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Bru's dogmatic quest for a cup of coffee lands him at the centre of a sinister alien conspiracy, where his stubbornness makes him an accidental hero - and t